{
  "id": "periodic-he-forces",
  "name": {
    "ja": "周期He₂の原子間力：解析力・有限差分・BOMD接続",
    "en": "Periodic-He₂ forces: analytic derivatives, finite differences and BOMD interface"
  },
  "problem_id": "periodic-he-forces",
  "method_ids": [
    "kohn-sham-dft",
    "electronic-bases",
    "scf",
    "xc-functionals",
    "pseudopotentials",
    "k-point"
  ],
  "scope": {
    "ja": "非対称な2原子He周期セル・局所GTH・LDA交換＋VWN5。PySCFの解析力（Gaussian基底の微分を含む）を全6座標のエネルギー有限差分とDFTK平面波参照で照合し、力の基底・k点・SCF・FFT収束を分離。BOMDの力供給と短い刻み比較に限定し、長時間NVE・CPMD・一般物質は未検証。",
    "en": "Asymmetric two-He periodic cell with local GTH and LDA exchange plus VWN5. Compare PySCF analytic forces, including Gaussian-basis derivatives, with energy finite differences for all six coordinates and independent DFTK plane waves. Separate force basis, k-point, SCF and FFT refinement. BOMD coverage is a force interface and short step comparison; long NVE, CPMD and general materials remain unvalidated."
  },
  "assumptions": {
    "ja": "固定した非対称2原子Heセル（5 bohr立方、4価電子、非偏極・整数占有、局所GTH、LDA_X＋VWN5）。PySCFライブラリを使う検証ドライバー。物理的な平衡He物質や長時間MDではありません。",
    "en": "Fixed asymmetric two-He cell (5-bohr cubic lattice, four valence electrons, unpolarized integer occupations, local GTH and LDA_X plus VWN5). A library-backed PySCF validation driver; not physical equilibrium helium or long-time MD."
  },
  "units": {
    "ja": "原子単位：エネルギー hartree/cell、力 hartree/bohr、核座標 bohr、質量 電子質量、時間 原子時間。",
    "en": "Atomic units: energy hartree/cell, force hartree/bohr, coordinates bohr, masses electron masses and atomic time."
  },
  "boundaries": {
    "ja": "3次元Bloch周期境界。中性セルにHe2原子・価電子4個。イオンEwald項を含む全エネルギーのCartesian微分。",
    "en": "Three-dimensional Bloch periodic boundaries. Two He atoms and four valence electrons per neutral cell. Cartesian derivatives of the total energy including ionic Ewald interactions."
  },
